# Minimal UI

Follow the repository guide in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).

- Package name: `@samikodiane/minimal-ui`
- Edit library code under `src/`; demo in `example/`
- Theme rules: one font; accent and shadow color are derived — never add public setters for them
- Expo SDK 57 docs: https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v57.0.0/
